@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+## Why
+
+The school wants to reward customers who rent for longer. Rentals of 3 or more days should cost 10% less than the full price.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- A rental period of 3 or more days is priced at 90% of `dailyPrice × days`, rounded to the nearest euro cent (halves round up).
+- Periods of 1 or 2 days keep the full price.
+- `quote` and `book` both return the reduced total (they share one pricing path).
+- README example/notes mention the discount.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+None.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `rental-booking`: the Quote and Booking requirements change so that `total` includes the long-rental discount.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/rental.ts` (pricing in `price()`), `src/rental.test.ts`, `README.md`.
+- Out of scope: discounts for other durations, per-item discounts, cancellation refunds (the refund policy still refers to the booking total as booked).
